Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: retain rothko lockscreen geometry without FOD
 bridge

Keep exactly the framework files retained in the tested services/SystemUI build. Legacy FOD services, touch plumbing and frame-commit illumination control are excluded. The unused FingerprintManager constants and default-false resource declarations remain for compatibility with the proven build; no active bridge implementation is shipped.

Co-authored-by: sisyphus-dev-ai <sisyphus-dev-ai@users.noreply.github.com>
